      "title": "START HERE \u2014 tested on this PC",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Start here: FLUX.2 Klein\n\n1. Edit the text in the **Prompt** node.\n2. Keep **512 \u00d7 512**, **batch 1**, **4 steps** for the tested preset.\n3. Press **Run**. Change the sampler seed for a new variation.\n\n**Verified on this PC, 9 Nov 2026:** 78.39 seconds; saved motorcycle image inspected. Local generation, no API credits.\n\nOther saved tests: **PC Test 01** SD1.5 = 15.23s; **PC Test 03** Z-Image = 222.90s; **PC Test 04** LC123 builds text and saves a palette (no AI scene generation).\n\nTimings are single runs with another workload occupying much of the GPU. Larger sizes and video have not been tested in this session.\n\nImages save under `output/PC_Workflow_Tests/`."
